clear a dead holder's lock on a worktree, its repository's shared services, the
registry, or the router, once the holder, and anything it left running, is
checked gone

Usage:
  treerig worktree unlock [identifier] [flags]

Flags:
      --config string         path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
      --domain string         narrow a slug registered under more than one
                              domain
  -h, --help                  help for unlock
      --holder-unverifiable   accept a holder this machine cannot check (another
                              machine or container, or no record), once you have
                              made sure it is gone
      --registry              clear the machine-wide worktree registry lock
                              instead of a worktree's
      --router                clear the shared router's lock instead of a
                              worktree's
      --shared                clear the shared-services lock of the worktree's
                              repository instead of the worktree's own locks

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto (redraw on a terminal) or
                        plain (one line per change) (default "auto")
  -v, --verbose         show what treerig runs, and every detail
